            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0659" n="535" xml:id="pg535"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.1211/65: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-04-21T22:00:00-07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 21,
                                1923—10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 22—1:02
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Your 31 April 20, 6 p.m. Identic statement proposed by Mr. Pani transmitted
                    textually in my cipher telegram 24 April 19, 6 p.m. will be published here in
                    the newspapers Tuesday morning April 24th. If date is satisfactory to the
                    Department please instruct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
